<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria to offer two discount T-bill issues Jan 6.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria to offer two discount T-bill issues Jan 6.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer two issues of discount T-bills with maturities of one week and four weeks respectively and a total par of 25 billion levs at auctions on Monday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	 BG 3010197005	BG3010297003</p>
<p> Par value	    5.0 billion levs   20 billion levs</p>
<p> Auction date	 January 6, 1996    January 6, 1997</p>
<p> Issue date	   January 8, 1997    January 8, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date	January 15, 1997   February 5, 1997</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
